's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"4b73387e586f3dbcf71545ea45c42013","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"d66bdad4713125b2363c199445db06ae","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"1ee51c0c73aafaf70c1ee17a438bb55e","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"6c84bb60683b441265d74bf0b6236dd7","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"e7de443a64276444257dd58b999024fa","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"3a5d79f4f9e48d063384829cc011b289","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"b139eeca1794ebfbd5a381408bae5f39","originalFileName":"6633e567-04ae-41c5-8ce7-b0b90bd5607b-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"9e38d7cd